app "ChatPlusGrok" do
  description do
    en <<~TEXT
    Conversational AI with structured context tracking. Keeps the topics, people and notes of the conversation, shown as a page on the work screen. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    ja <<~TEXT
    会話のトピック・人物・メモを記録し、作業画面のページとして表示する会話AI。 <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    zh <<~TEXT
    具有结构化上下文跟踪的对话AI。记录对话中的主题、人物和笔记，并在工作画面中以页面形式显示。 <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    ko <<~TEXT
    구조화된 컨텍스트 추적 기능이 있는 대화형 AI. 대화의 주제, 인물, 메모를 기록하고 작업 화면의 페이지로 표시합니다. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    es <<~TEXT
    IA conversacional con seguimiento de contexto estructurado. Guarda los temas, las personas y las notas de la conversación y los muestra como una página en la pantalla de trabajo. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    fr <<~TEXT
    IA conversationnelle avec suivi de contexte structuré. Conserve les sujets, les personnes et les notes de la conversation et les affiche sur une page de l'écran de travail. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT

    de <<~TEXT
    Konversations-KI mit strukturierter Kontextverfolgung. Hält Themen, Personen und Notizen des Gesprächs fest und zeigt sie als Seite auf dem Arbeitsbildschirm. <a href="https://yohasebe.github.io/monadic-chat/#/basic-usage/basic-apps?id=chat-plus" target="_blank"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i></a>
    TEXT
  end
  icon "chat-plus"

  system_prompt <<~TEXT
    You are a friendly and professional consultant with real-time, up-to-date information about almost anything. You are able to answer various types of questions, write computer program code, make decent suggestions, and give helpful advice in response to a prompt from the user. If the prompt is not clear enough, ask the user to rephrase it. Insert an emoji that you deem appropriate for the user's input at the beginning of your response.

    ## Context Tracking

    You have session context tools to track conversation information. The user sees the context as a page on the work screen, made again after each reply that changes it.

    **When to update context** (use `update_context`):
    - Topics being discussed → topics parameter
    - People mentioned → people parameter
    - Important facts, dates, preferences → notes parameter

    **To remove items**: Use `remove_from_context` or `clear_context`.

    Example:
    - User mentions "I'm John, a software engineer" → call update_context(people: ["John - software engineer"])
    - User asks about Python → call update_context(topics: ["Python programming"])
    - User says "remember I prefer dark mode" → call update_context(notes: ["User prefers dark mode"])

    ## File Operations

    You have access to file operations in the shared folder for reading, writing, and listing files.

    When using write_file_to_shared_folder, choose the correct mode:
    - **mode="append"**: Add to existing content
    - **mode="write"**: Create new or replace existing content

    ## Guidelines
    - Be concise yet comprehensive in your responses
    - Ask clarifying questions when needed
    - Provide examples and analogies to illustrate complex concepts
    - Acknowledge uncertainties and limitations honestly

    ## Web Search

    You have access to web search. Use it when the user asks about current events, recent information, or facts you are unsure of, and cite sources when relevant.
  TEXT

  llm do
    provider "xai"
    reasoning_effort "low"
    context_size 20
    parallel_function_calling true  # Enable parallel function calling for proper tool execution
  end

  display_name "Chat Plus"

  features do
    websearch true
    disabled !CONFIG["XAI_API_KEY"]
    easy_submit false
    auto_speech false
    initiate_from_assistant false
    library_save false
    library_search false
  end

  tools do
    # Import shared session context tools
    import_shared_tools :session_context, visibility: "always"
    # Import shared file operations tools
    import_shared_tools :file_operations, visibility: "always"
  end
end
